      "text": "With respect to work on In-Rem buildings which\nmust be performed immediately in order to provide\nheat to tenants of such buildings thereby correct-\ning an emergency situation which is dangerous to\nhuman life and safety and detrimental to health,\nthe Department of Housing Preservation and Develop-\nment or any successor agency shall adopt a plan\nfor the letting of such emergency contracts to\ncontractors appearing on a list of approved con-\ntractors. The plan and any amendment thereto\nshall provide as follows:",
